### Raw benchmarks found (3 independent searches, compared)

1. `openai.com` / `openai.com/index/introducing-gpt-6-1-sol/` (official docs): Confirms GPT-6.1 Sol and GPT-6 Astra releases; NO mention of "GPT-6 Luna". Official model list does not contain this ID.
2. `artificialanalysis.ai/models/gpt-6-luna` (independent benchmark aggregator): Page exists (`GPT-6 Luna (max)`) but shows evaluation framework description only (`Intelligence Index v4.3.2`) with no extracted score numbers in the fetched text (`No publicly available API` noted repeatedly). Confirms the label is tracked by Artificial Analysis, but does not provide verified benchmark values.
3. `openai.com/products/gpt-6-luna` (direct product URL attempt): Returns 404 (`The path has gone faint`). Confirms no official product page exists for this exact ID.

> **Conflict / comparison:** The dataset (`model-queue.md`) assigns Overall 83.8 to `gpt-6-luna`, and Artificial Analysis tracks the label in its evaluation framework, but there is no official OpenAI model card or API endpoint for "GPT-6 Luna". The closest verified OpenAI releases are `gpt-6.1-sol` and `gpt-6-astra`. Independent sources conflict on whether this is a real released SKU vs. a dataset/composite label.

